  "description": {
   "en": "A girl who falls in love way too easily is working hard to take over her grandparents' café. To stay focused on her dream, she swore off love completely. But one day, a new part-timer shows up at the café—he looks like a total delinquent, and things start to get complicated…\n\n(Source: Manga Park, translated)\n\n---\nNote: The one-shot published in the December 1, 2024 issue of The Hana to Yume and was serialized."
  },
